app.vulkan.no_loader = schist: kute silayishi se-Vulkan kuloluhlelo, ngako kute lokungadvwetjwa ngako.\n\nSchist idvweba nge-Vulkan, futsi `libvulkan.so.1` ayikafakwa.\nKudzingeka silayishi kanye nesishayeli:\n\n    Arch, CachyOS, Omarchy    sudo pacman -S vulkan-icd-loader vulkan-driver\n    Debian, Ubuntu, Mint      sudo apt install libvulkan1 mesa-vulkan-drivers\n    Fedora, RHEL              sudo dnf install vulkan-loader mesa-vulkan-drivers\n
app.vulkan.override_missing = schist: sishayeli se-Vulkan lesikhonjwe nguleseshini asikho.\n\n{var} isethiwe, futsi kusetha yona *kutsatsa indzawo* yekusesha kwesilayishi\netishayelini esikhundleni sekungeta kuko. Ngako lamafayela, langekho,\nngilo lonkhe luhla lwetishayeli -- futsi lonkhe luhlelo lwe-Vulkan kuliseshini\naluboni ngisho sinye sishayeli, noma kungabe kufakwe letingaki:\n\n{missing}\n    {var}={value}\n\nYikhombe kumanifest lakhona -- tishayeli letifakiwe tibeka emanifest ato ku-\n/usr/share/vulkan/icd.d -- nobe uyekele kuyisetha bese uvumela silayishi sititfolele.\nIseshini lesetha loku efayeleni lekulungiselela (`env =` ye-Hyprland, lifayela\nlelingetwe ku-systemd environment.d, iphrofayela ye-shell) kufanele ilungiswe lapho,\nfutsi lolushintjo ludzingeka kungena kabusha kuze lufinyelele lokusevele kusebenta.\n
app.vulkan.override_note = \n{var} isethwe yaba ngu-{value}, futsi loko kutsatsa indzawo yekusesha kwesilayishi:\nnangabe kute kulawo mamanifest lelikalomshini, kuyekela kuyisetha yintfo\nyekucala lokufanele uyizame.\n
app.vulkan.no_driver = schist: kute sishayeli se-Vulkan lesifakiwe, ngako kute lokungadvwetjwa kuso.\n\nSchist idvweba nge-Vulkan. Silayishi sifakiwe kodvwa sibika kutsi kute\nsishayeli -- kute lesibhalisiwe kunobe nguyiphi indzawo kulena lemibili leseshwa kuyo:\n\n{dirs}\n\nSilayishi sitfunyelwa sehlukene netishayeli, ngako loku kuvamise kuba liphakheji\nlinye lelingekho.\n\nFaka sishayeli se-GPU yalomshini:\n\n    Arch, CachyOS, Omarchy    sudo pacman -S vulkan-driver\n    Debian, Ubuntu, Mint      sudo apt install mesa-vulkan-drivers\n    Fedora, RHEL              sudo dnf install mesa-vulkan-drivers\n\nSishayeli se-NVIDIA lesiphatsekako sita naso (`nvidia-utils` ku-Arch,\n`nvidia-driver` ku-Debian). Emshinini longuwelizinga, nobe lapho kute khona\nsishayeli se-GPU lesingafakwa, i-rasteriser yesofthiwe ngiyo lesebentako:\n`vulkan-swrast` ku-Arch, iyincenye ye-`mesa-vulkan-drivers` kuletinye tindzawo.\nIyanensa, kodvwa iyacala.\n{overridden}
app.vulkan.no_device = schist: sishayeli se-Vulkan sifakiwe kodvwa asiniki divayisi yekudvweba kuyo.\n\nKungenteka sishayeli asiyisekeli le-GPU, nobe singakwati kuyifinyelela --\nnge-SSH nobe ekhatsi kwesiqukatsi, /dev/dri ivamise kuba yintfo\nlengekhoyo. `vulkaninfo --summary` ibika loko lokubonwa silayishi.\n\nI-rasteriser yesofthiwe idvweba ngaphandle kwe-GPU, nangabe nguloko\nlomshini lonako: `vulkan-swrast` ku-Arch, iyincenye ye-`mesa-vulkan-drivers`\nku-Debian naku-Fedora.\n
app.vulkan.skip_hint = Kuze ucalise Schist nome kunjalo bese uyiyekela yehluleke ngendlela yayo, setha {var}=1.
